  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced.\n• Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray, add a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper. Sprinkle mixed sesame seeds over the wedges.\n• Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8109f5ad8e6534c4929b/step-7ecccf00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine mayonnaise, sesame oil blend (see ingredients) and the soy sauce. Set aside.\n• Cut tofu into 2cm chunks. Little cooks: Take charge by combining the sauces!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8109f5ad8e6534c4929b/step-d9190210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a shallow bowl, combine Southeast Asian spice blend, the plain flour and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg.\n• In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip tofu chunks into flour mixture, followed by the egg and finally into the panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate. Little cooks: Help crumb the tofu! Use one hand for the wet ingredients and the other for the dry ingredients to avoid sticky fingers. Make sure to wash your hands well afterwards.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8109f5ad8e6534c4929b/step-1b79a520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8109f5ad8e6534c4929b/step-2585db30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves and slaw mix.\n• Add Japanese-style dressing just before serving and toss to coat. Season to taste. Little cooks: Take the lead by tossing the slaw!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8109f5ad8e6534c4929b/step-fff52140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Southeast Asian crumbed tofu, sesame potato wedges and Asian slaw between plates.\n• Serve with sesame mayo. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8109f5ad8e6534c4929b/step-c4a9ff50.jpg"
    }
  ]
